# Validation

## API input

Dung Jakarta Validation khi phu hop:

- @NotNull, @NotBlank, @NotEmpty
- @Positive, @PositiveOrZero, @Negative
- @Min/0/ @Max/100/
- @Size/min = 1, max = 255/
- @Email
- @Pattern/regexp = .../
- @Valid - cho nested object

- Validation annotation tren DTO request.
- @Valid tren @RequestBody de trigger.
- Field-level error tra trong data cua ApiResponse /xem api-conventions.mdc/.

## Business validation

- Validation phuc tap /multi-table, multi-step/ nam trong **Service**, throw BusinessException/*ErrorCode/.
- Khong throw RuntimeException thuan - luon kem ErrorCode.
